WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:11.159
My brother Bada is not as healthy as he seems.

2
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.467
Mom: Bada, you have a runny nose.

3
00:00:14.468 --> 00:00:16.568
Bada: I do?

4
00:00:16.569 --> 00:00:18.050
Mom: Here is a tissue.

5
00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:20.163
Blow your nose.

6
00:00:20.164 --> 00:00:23.777
Bada: Oh, Mom!

7
00:00:23.778 --> 00:00:26.118
Mom: What's wrong?

8
00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:29.147
Bada: My nose is bleeding!

9
00:00:29.148 --> 00:00:31.543
Mom: Come over here and let me see.

10
00:00:31.544 --> 00:00:33.932
Keep your head down.

11
00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.796
Bada: Will it stop?

12
00:00:35.797 --> 00:00:38.450
Mom: It will stop soon. Don't worry.

13
00:00:38.451 --> 00:00:41.291
Here, drink this milk.

14
00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:45.419
Bada: Mom, it's too hot.

15
00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:48.045
Mom: No, it's just warm.

16
00:00:48.046 --> 00:00:49.536
Drink it all.

17
00:00:49.537 --> 00:00:51.682
How do you feel?

18
00:00:51.683 --> 00:00:56.202
Bada: Ahh, I feel much better.

19
00:00:56.203 --> 00:00:59.563
Mom: You should drink more milk every day, Bada.

20
00:00:59.564 --> 00:01:02.928
Bada: I know, I know.

21
00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.250
Mom: Go to the bathroom and take a shower now.

22
00:01:06.251 --> 00:01:08.779
Bada: Yes, ma'am!

23
00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:11.201
He doesn't look sick to me.

24
00:01:11.202 --> 00:01:14.161
I am sure he was picking his nose.

25
00:01:14.162 --> 00:01:16.240
That's why it was bleeding.

26
00:01:16.241 --> 00:01:19.425
Bada, stop picking your nose!
